        <h2>Sources</h2>
        <ul class="sources">
          <li>IUPAC, <a href="https://goldbook.iupac.org/terms/view/12214" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gold Book, molar mass</a>, 2025 (mass divided by amount of substance).</li>
